WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.640
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start!

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.380
When watching Kaleido Star,
please keep the room brightly lit,

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.040
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.120
I'm Sora Naegino.
I came to America all by myself

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:15.850
with aspirations of joining Kaleido Stage.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.620
Everything is new to me,

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:21.090
but I'm doing my best in the spirit of
"try it rather than think about it."

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.460
There's nothing I can't do if I try

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.290
and if I can do it without trying,
I'd be super lucky.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.390
And if I'm gonna do it, I just gotta do it!
Gotta! Gotta! That's me.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:32.830
Well, well, well, does everyone
have a lot of friends?

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.870
Friends you can have fun with
and laugh with.

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.240
Sometime you have fights,

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.810
but you help each other even
during sad or rough times.

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:40.140
Precious friends like that.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.410
I'm going to work hard with the help
of Mia and Anna too!

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:45.970
I'm gonna! I'm gonna!

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:05.660
<i>Yaritai koto wa nani</i>

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:05.660
<i>What is it that you want to do?</i>

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>Sou kikareru tabi</i>

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>Every time I was asked that</i>

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:13.070
<i>Aoi sora miageta</i>

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:13.070
<i>I looked up at the blue sky</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.080
<i>Kotae wa only my heart</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.080
<i>The answer is only in my heart</i>

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:24.590
<i>Honto ni daiji na kotoba wa
kantan ni wa iwanai</i>

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:24.590
<i>I don't easily say the words
that are really important</i>

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:31.890
<i>Hikari ga yubisasu basho e to hashiridasu yo</i>

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:31.890
<i>I start running towards the place
the light points to</i>

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:39.840
<i>Dakishimetai mono nara
nakitai hodo mune ni aru</i>

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:39.840
<i>There's so much in my heart that I want
to embrace, I could cry</i>

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:46.810
<i>Egakitsuzukete yuku kitto
take it someday</i>

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:46.810
<i>I'll keep painting my way, I promise,
take it someday</i>

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:54.780
<i>Shiroi kumo ga nagareru
chiheisen no mukou ni</i>

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:54.780
<i>Beyond the horizon, where
the white clouds drift</i>

00:01:54.780 --> 00:02:06.520
<i>Naranderu mirai wa itsumo
soba ni aru kara</i>

00:01:54.780 --> 00:02:06.520
<i>The future is lined up and
it'll always be there by my side</i>

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:31.050
Guiding you to a fantastic, exciting,
and intoxicating world,

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:34.180
Kaleido Stage's new production, Cinderella!

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:38.960
Of course, the main cast members are
Layla Hamilton and Yuri Killian.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.130
In addition, we have boldly
included new members

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:44.290
who joined our troupe this year.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:49.740
We're going to present a dramatic stage
with an unbelievable illusion.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:50.570
You'll be a part of the dawning of a new era
in performance!

