00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:18.830
Oh, well... There are a lot of
circumstances behind this

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:21.070
and it's not exactly that I'm "not allowed
on the stage"...

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:22.700
You must be pretty bad.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:26.130
If you put it that way,
you could say that I'm pretty bad.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:29.650
But you know, everyone's bad
when they first start out.

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:30.650
Even someone terrible can get better
if she works harder...

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:31.650
What a loser.

